  "source": "JoyPro curated on the maker's photo (2026-10-11), STECS Max with left Space Throttle Grip (STECS-MAX-STG-L_03) seen from the right front and above: grip thumb face, ATEM module in the foreground, base panel, STEM panel behind on the right",
  "mappingSource": "catalog vkb.json: EDCD community map 231D0139 (https://github.com/EDCD/EliteCustomButtonNames/blob/main/files/INTO%20Bindings/DeviceButtonMaps/231D0139.buttonMap, factory profile); grip control names and spots from VKB's STECS Space Throttle LH template v1.0 (https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0808/7827/2731/files/VKB-STECS-SpaceThrottleGrip-LH-v1.0.pdf: H1, HAT1, B1, B2, SPEED LIM, H2, Pointer Hat, Main Trigger), ATEM template v1.0 (https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0808/7827/2731/files/VKB-STECS-ATEM-v1.0.pdf) and STEM template v1.0 (https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0808/7827/2731/files/VKB-STECS-STEM-v1.0_1d344eed-eb3d-4326-bff2-541f981d4e2a.pdf), all linked on https://vkbsimcontrollers.com/pages/downloads; printed labels on the grip and the STEM panel",
  "confidence": "medium",
